              "value": "Trumpet Blast"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, primal, sonic)\n\nThe oppali emits a massive blast of discordant noise that deals 9d8 sonic damage to creatures within a 60-foot cone (DC 29 basic Fortitude save). Creatures who fail the save are also deafened for 1 round. The oppali can't use its Trumpet Blast again for 1d4 rounds or until it takes at least 20 points of sonic damage from a single source (whichever comes first)."
